          "speaker": "Arif",
          "text": "I'm fine, thank you. And you?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Dewi",
          "text": "I'm fine too. See you in class!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Arif",
          "text": "See you!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
